node_modules/
dist/
build/
.env
.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store
wispfield-files/

# Throwaway sandbox for `npm run oobe:*` (scripts/oobe.js) — regenerated by `oobe:reset`, never
# meant to be shared or committed.
.oobe-sandbox/

# node-windows service install artifacts (scripts/service-install.js / server/daemon/windrow.xml
# reference) — generated per-machine by `npm run service:install`, and windrow.xml in particular
# bakes in the installing machine's real username, hostname, and absolute repo path. Never commit
# these; anyone installing the service gets their own copy regenerated locally.
server/daemon/*.exe
server/daemon/*.exe.config
server/daemon/*.xml

# Internal security reviews and audits. These enumerate the broker's attack surface and the
# host's own filesystem layout, so they stay local — the architecture docs under docs/design/
# that README links are the public ones.
docs/design/governance-vulnerability-review.md
docs/design/governance-review-*.md
docs/design/secrets-audit-*.md
